    description: Some("Ten runs down the mountain, five slalom and five downhill, timed to the hundredth of a second. You do not steer directly: you angle the skis, and the longer you hold a direction the further they swing, with top speed only when they point straight down. Missing a slalom gate costs five seconds."),
